# Golang
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe
*.dll
*.out
*.test
*.prof
coverage.txt
coverage.html
dist/
bin/

# Build artifacts
# Both patterns are anchored on purpose. A bare "codamigo" would also match the
# cmd/codamigo source directory and hide every file added under it.
/codamigo
# `go build ./cmd/codamigo/` run from inside that directory, rather than the
# `make build` target, leaves the binary here.
/cmd/codamigo/codamigo
/build/

